# OS / editor cruft
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/

# local tooling
node_modules/
*.log

# Built by build.mjs and published by .github/workflows/pages.yml. Never committed: the
# repo carries the source, the workflow builds the artifact, and a committed dist/ would
# be a second copy free to disagree with the first.
dist/

# per-machine Claude Code settings
.claude/

# Design handoff packages, dropped in the root to be unpacked and applied. The repo
# carries the applied result - docs/design-brief.md and the CSS - not the archive, and
# Pages serves this directory, so a committed zip would be publicly downloadable too.
*.zip

# Regenerable in one command (python3 verify/dump_bis_raw.py) and 6 MB of scraped rows.
# The repo carries the tools and the decisions, not a snapshot of somebody else the size
# of the rest of the data put together.
verify/bis-raw.json
